उप-करण, अम्, n. doing anything for another,
doing a service or favour, helping, assisting; instru-
ment, implement, machine, engine, apparatus, para-
phernalia, as the vessels and offerings at a sacrifice;
anything added over and above, contribution, expedi-
ent, means of subsistence, anything supporting life;
object of art or science, fabricating, composing, &c.;
the insignia of royalty; the attendants of a king.
—उपकरण-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, furnished with means,
instruments or implements, competent to do anything.

उपचित्र उप-चित्र, अस्, m., N. of a man;
(आ), f. the plants Salvinia Cuculluta and Croton
Polyandra; N. of several metres, namely, 1. a variety
of Mātrāsamaka, containing 4×16 syllabic instants;
2. a metre of four lines of eleven syllables each; 3. a
metre of two lines of twenty-two syllables each.

उप-जापक, अस्, आ, अम्, whispering anything into
the ears, rousing to rebellion; a traitor, treacherous;
a mischief-maker, one who foments quarrels.

उप-ताप, अस्, m. heat, warmth, heating, paining,
pain, trouble, misfortune; sickness, disease, injury;
haste, hurry.

2. उप-दा, आस्, आस्, अम्, Ved. giving a present;
(आ), f. a present, an offering to a king or great man
&c.; a Nazr.

उप-देह, अस्, m. a cover; liniment, ointment;
(उप implying inferiority) a minor or secondary body
growing on diseased parts of the body.

उप-दिष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, specified, particularized;
taught, instructed, advised; assigned as a plea or
reason; initiated; (अम्), n. council, advice.

उपदेव उप-देव, अस्, m. an inferior deity;
N. of a son of Akrūra; also of Devaka; (ई), f., N.
of the wife of Vasu-deva; of a daughter of Devaka.

उपाधा उपा-धा (उप-आ-), cl. 3. P. A. -द-
धाति, -धत्ते, -धातुम्, to place near, place upon;
to offer; render, make, effect, fix; to keep, hold.

उपधूपित उप-धूपित, अस्, आ, अम्, fumigated;
one to whom decline or death is near; being at the
point of death; suffering extreme pain.

उप-न्यस्त, अस्, आ, अम्, placed near to or upon;
pledged, intrusted, deposited; given, communicated;
brought forward as an example &c., adduced, hinted,
suggested.

उप-न्यास, अस्, m. placing near to, juxta-position;
intrusting, a deposit, pledge, a pawn, a hostage;
statement, suggestion, hint, pretext, an exordium or
introduction; a precept, a law.

उपभुज् उप-भुज्, cl. 7. P. A. -भुनक्ति,
-भुङ्क्ते, -भोक्तुम्, to enjoy, eat, possess, use;
make use of, receive (as a reward).

उप-याम, अस्, m., Ved. taking up with a ladle;
a ladle (?); the verses or formulas uttered in ladling
out the Soma juice; marriage.

उप-याचित, अस्, आ, अम्, requested, solicited; offered,
especially to the deities to render them propitious;
(अम्), n. prayer, request (to a deity).

उपयुज् उप-युज्, cl. 7. P. A. -युनक्ति, युन्-
क्ते, -योक्तुम्, to harness (as horses to a carriage); to
occupy, take possession of; to use, employ, apply;
to bestow upon; to attach one's self to, be devoted to;
to appropriate, consume, eat.

उपारम् उपा-रम् (उप-आ-), cl. 1. A. -रमते,
-रन्तुम्, to sport, take one's pleasure, delight in;
to cease; to rest.

उपरि may also be used at the end of a compound;
e. g. तदुपरि गन्तुम्, to fall upon him, to attack
him.

उप-रोध, अस्, m. surrounding, blockading; ob-
struction, impediment, opposition, check, refusal;
trouble, disturbance; binding, tying, taking hold of;
protection, favour.
—उपरोध-कारिन्, ई, इणी, इ,
causing trouble, obstructing.

उप-लेप, अस्, m. smearing, anointing, plastering;
obstruction, the being concealed; becoming deadened
or dull.

उप-वेश, अस्, m. sitting down, sitting, resting;
fixing one's mind upon, being attached to; voiding
by stool.

उपविष उप-विष, अम्, n. factitious poison;
a narcotic, any deterious drug, as opium, datura, &c.;
(आ), f. a plant, Atis, Aconitum or Betula. See अति-
विषा.

उप-शान्ति, इस्, f. cessation, intermission, remission;
appeasing, allaying, assuaging; abatement; tranquil-
lity, calm.

उप-श्रुति, इस्, f. giving ear to, listening to; range
of hearing; a supernatural voice heard at night and
personified as a nocturnal deity revealing the future;
judicial astrology, aspect of the stars, fortune-telling;
promise, assent.

उप-सर, अस्, आ, or ई, अम्, who or what approaches;
(अस्), m. approaching (a cow); the first pregnancy or
impregnation of a cow.

उपसृप् उप-सृप्, cl. 1. P. A. -सर्पति, -ते,
-सर्प्तुम् or -स्रप्तुम्, to creep near, approach;
move onward, attack; [cf. ὑφέρπω]

उप-हृत, अस्, आ, अम्, offered, presented; im-
molated, offered as a victim; served out as food;
taken, collected, gathered.

); a spiritual teacher,
a teacher in general; (आ), f. a female preceptor; (ई),
f. a female teacher or the wife of a teacher.

उपा-श्रित, अस्, आ, अम्, relying or depending upon;
supporting (literally or figuratively), bearing, holding,
protecting.

उपासितव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be served or worshipped;
to be attended to, to be accomplished; to be regarded
or considered.

1. उपास्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be served or worshipped;
to be attended to or accomplished; to be respected;
to be regarded or considered.
—उपास्य-ता, f. or
उपास्य-त्व, अम्, n. respectability, placability.
